    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nA spacious and well-presented three-bedroom terraced residence extending to approximately 115 sq.m. (1,238 sq.ft.), ideally situated on St. John's Street, just a short stroll from Enniscorthy town centre and all amenities.\n\nThis attractive property comes to the market in very good condition throughout and offers bright, generously proportioned accommodation over two floors. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable living room with feature fireplace, a separate dining room, a modern fitted kitchen with dining area, and a guest W.C. To the rear is a private enclosed patio area with side access.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms and a spacious family bathroom. In addition, the property benefits from a substantial attic room which provides excellent additional space suitable for a variety of uses including a home office, hobby room or storage. \n\nA notable feature of the property is its side access to the street, providing convenient independent access to the rear patio area. The home also enjoys a highly convenient location within walking distance of schools, shops, restaurants, public transport and all the amenities that Enniscorthy town has to offer.\n\nThis property will appeal to a wide range of purchasers including first-time buyers, families, investors and those seeking a centrally located home with generous accommodation.\n\nInteractive Tour: https://visithome.ai/aLEjnN4DQPxLeXnXPVe9Bu?mu=m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - 1.07m x 5.19m\n\n\nHall - 1.74m x 1.27m\n\n\nW.c. - 1.76m x 1.41m\n\n\nStorage - 2.77m x 1.62m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.83m x 2.91m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.35m x 4.02m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.51m x 5.41m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 4.54m x 2.70m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.70m x 2.59m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.36m x 3.33m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 1.76m x 4.23m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.97m x 2.71m\n\n\nMain Bath - 3.52m x 2.72m\n\n\n"
      },
